a. social affairs;
b. health;
c. education;
d. manpower;
e. population and civil registration;
f. law;
g. women's empowerment and child protection;
h. cooperatives and micro enterprises;
i. mental and spiritual; andj. peace and order.
2. Prevention of acts of violence by Regional Apparatus as referred to in paragraph (1), is carried out in an integrated and continuous manner based on the RPJPD and RPJMD.

